  <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
  <h2 class="head">From East Kalimantan to Bali, three names, one practice.</h2>
  <div class="about">
    <p>I build brand identity and run digital marketing for founders who don't have an internal team to do it themselves. I started the practice in 2023 while based in East Kalimantan, first as <strong>WWJ</strong>, then <strong>Matari.allo</strong>, before it became <strong>Allo.Society</strong>. By the time I moved to Bali in 2026, Allo.Society was already the name running brand builds from scratch, campaign strategy, CRM systems, and social management across multiple brands.</p>
    <p>Before that, I ran paid media and CRM for other people's clients: 88 Meta Ads campaigns across four brands at Dream Box, a HubSpot sequence at KKBC that hit 14.4% click-through against a 2–3% industry benchmark, a brand launched to page-one Google rankings at RevoU.</p>
    <p>I also spent years running physical operations, fleets, factories, compliance systems, across East and South Kalimantan before Blue Tick Ice brought me to Bali. That's why the marketing here is built to hold up under scrutiny, not just look good.</p>
  </div>
